; lighthouse_top.room - Lanterna do Farol (design 04 section 3.3): a flat floor (row 21, cols 3-36) under the lantern's
; roof, with the hatch door (col 30, east of the lamp's axis) down to lighthouse_interior, always open (STORY-34).
; The mentor (STORY-34, systems/story) stands at x 720 facing west to the lowered lamp (x 656), his back to the hatch:
; his talk starts as Ivo comes near from the east (col 23, legend t, auto); in stasis, Up on him says "..." (col 22,
; legend t). Once the four guardians are restored the final arena (GRD-06) holds his guardian body in the same place.

